# Brand colours (amvara.de)

Source of truth: live `amvara.de` + `design/tokens.css`.

| Role | Light | Notes |
|------|-------|-------|
| Background | `#f9f9f9` / `#fafafa` | Calm ground |
| Text | `#032047` | Navy, primary copy |
| Muted | `#808080` | Secondary copy |
| Accent | `#f1162f` | CTA, delay emphasis, underline |
| On accent | `#ffffff` | Text on red buttons |
| Secondary | `#1976d2` | theme-color, focus, links |
| Font | Open Sans | Match Amvara; bold via weight 700 |

Dark mode: see `design/tokens.css` (`prefers-color-scheme`). Keep red as the loud accent.

## Do not

- Do not use Material default indigo `#3f51b5` or pink `#ff4081` as brand.
- Do not invent a purple / terracotta / cream SaaS palette.
- Do not put body text on glass over photos without AA contrast.

When adding UI colours, extend tokens first, then reference `var(--color-*)`.
